<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh inflation slows to 1.7 pct in Feb.</title>
<headline>Kazakh inflation slows to 1.7 pct in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's monthly consumer price inflation slowed in February to 1.7 percent from 2.1 percent in January, the State Statistics Comittee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKH CONSUMER PRICES     Feb '97     Jan '97     Feb '96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change    +1.7	  +2.1	  +2.5</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change     +25.2	 +26.2	 +47.3</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
